        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia Stainless Steel Patio Door Trim Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith its modern design, this Omnia patio leverset is the perfect addition to any contemporary home. The brushed stainless steel finish brings out the sleek look of the multipoint trim. These contemporary stainless steel leversets from Omnia are for use with American Cylinder Below (american profile lock cylinder below the door lever) type multipoint mortise locksets commonly found on swinging patio doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Thru-Bolts</b> are fixed at 9-1/2\" center to center and can not be modified. In some cases new thru-bolting holes must be drilled in your door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis set does not come packaged with the multipoint lock mechanism (the vertical rods found in multipoint patio doors that secure the door to the frame) as those are typically preinstalled in multipoint doors and cannot be replaced. The multipoint trim set is intended to replace the original trim from G-U, Marvin Integrity, KML by Anderson, Atrium, Superior, and others. The <b>Lock to Lever</b> distance is 3-5/8\" (92 mm).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74577-SM.jpg?v=1704354547\" width=\"500\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"73000ACB Multipoint Trim Sets dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: Rounded Patio Door Trim <a href=\"/products/rounded-european-cylinder-patio-door-trim-set-omnia-73000ecb\">with <b>European Cylinder</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/rounded-american-cylinder-patio-door-trim-set-omnia-73000aca\">with <b>American Cylinder Above</b> the lever</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Omnia 73000ACB Multipoint Trim Sets\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel Trim</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Lock to Lever Spacing: 3-5/8\" (92 mm) Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Thru-Bolt Hole Spacing: 9-1/2\"  (242 mm) Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\" (280 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-5/8\" (40 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 7/16\" (10 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
